f8c016f9: ;
 .;Edit Controls for FileMan ViEW of the 'DT' Multiple of the DICTATED
 .;PROGRESS NOTES file (#393).
 .;
 .;This will display :
 .;(1) DICTATED BY;
 .;(2) DATE TRANSCRIBED;
 .;(3) TRANSCRIBED BY;
 .;(4) DATE SIGNED;
 .;(5) SIGNED BY;
 .;(6) DATE REVIEWED;
 .;(7) REVIEWED BY.
 .;
 .;The editing of this multiple is driven by the DICTATED STATUS
 .;field which is a pointer to the DICTATED STATUS file (#393.2).
 .;
 .;The values of the DICTATED STATUS have the following effects on
 .;editing :
 .;
 .;INCOMPLETE : Will allow editing of the DICTATED BY field.
 .;DICTATED   : Will allow editing of DATE TRANSCRIBED.
 .;TRANSCRIBED: Will allow editing of TRANSCRIBED BY, DATE SIGNED and
 .;             SIGNED BY fields.
 .;SIGNED     : Will allow editing of DATE REVIEWED, and REVIEWED BY fields.
 .;REVIEWED   : Will not allow editing at this level.

